# All Changes Made to RE_Document_AI (backend-v2)

> [!NOTE]
> 27 files modified, 1 file deleted, 2 files added — across the entire backend-v2 codebase.

---

## 1. Architecture — Removed FallbackChain, Switched to Direct Providers

The biggest structural change: the entire **FallbackChain** abstraction was removed. Instead of routing calls through a chain-of-responsibility pattern (`chain.call("chat", ...)`), all providers are now called **directly** via their native methods (`.chat()`, `.extract()`, `.analyze()`, `.embed()`).

