#### [DELETE] [fallback.py](file:///c:/Users/MrYashGupta/Desktop/Re_DocumentAI/RE_Document_AI/backend-v2/platform_core/resilience/fallback.py)
- The entire `FallbackChain` class (83 lines) was deleted.

#### [MODIFY] [registry.py](file:///c:/Users/MrYashGupta/Desktop/Re_DocumentAI/RE_Document_AI/backend-v2/platform_core/registry.py)
