## 9. Method Call Style — `.call("method", ...)` → Direct Methods

All `chain.call("method", ...)` patterns replaced with direct provider method calls:

| Old Pattern | New Pattern |
|---|---|
| `ocr_chain.call("extract", ...)` | `ocr.extract(...)` |
| `vision_chain.call("analyze", ...)` | `vision.analyze(...)` |
| `embedding_chain.call("embed", ...)` | `embedding.embed(...)` |
| `llm.call("chat", ...)` | `llm.chat(...)` |

