## Summary

The core theme of all changes: **simplify the provider layer by removing the FallbackChain abstraction and introducing Mistral Studio Agent routing**, making each pipeline step call the Mistral Agents API directly with its pre-configured Agent ID, while fixing duplicate detection, Docker build size, and provider compatibility along the way.
